# Keep shell scripts LF-only so they run on Linux
*.sh text eol=lf
.github/workflows/*.yml text eol=lf

# Normalise text to LF and KEEP it LF in the working tree. `* text=auto`
# on its own only normalises on commit — with PortableGit's system-level
# `core.autocrlf=true`, the working tree still gets rewritten to CRLF on
# every checkout, which is what made the deployed file larger than the
# repo. eol=lf is the part that actually pins it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
